        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūgīsha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nene Simioni Petelo, nsese na ntūng'wa o ng'wa Yesu Kilisito; kū banhū abo kūlwa būtūngīlīja bo ng'wa Mulungu na Mpīja wise Seeba Yesu Kilisito, bamala kwanukūla kūzunya gītī kwise, ūyo gūlī mhayo gwa mpango ntaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shigongo na mhola shibize hamò ning'we mu wingī bo kūseesekela, kūlwa kūng'witegeleja mu būshikanu bose ū Mulungu nū Yesu Seeba wise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwitanwa na kūsolwa kwa nzunya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būdūla bo ng'wa Mulungu, watwinhile pyī īyo ītwigeleelilwe kūbiza nayo kūlwa būpanga na wela, tūng'witegeleje mu būshikanu bose; tūmane gīkī hū wei ū ng'witani wise kwingīla ng'wikūjo na mu wiza bokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu mihayo yenīyo watwinhile kwisagīlwa kwawiza na kwa mpango ntaale, gīkī ū muyo, mubize na būsangī ū mu nhūngwa ja wela bo ng'wa Mulungu, mupīle ng'wīnge ū mu būsoso bo mu sī ūbo būlī kūlwa kwikūmva. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, gemagi no no no kongeja wiza a ha kūzunya kwing'we, a ha wiza ng'ongeje witegeleja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ha witegeleja wilang'hani, a ha wilang'hani wiyūmīlīja, a ha wiyūmīlīja wela, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a ha wela kwitogwa kwa nyadūgū, a ha kwitogwa kwa nyadūgū, būtogwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ī mihayo yenīyī ūlū ng'ūbiza nayo mutūbiza binogolelwa; nīyo ūlū ng'wīkwīja mutūgayiwa matwajo ū mu kūng'witegeleja ū Seeba wise Yesu Kilisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ūyo atī nayo ī mihayo yenīyo mboku, atabonaga ī kūle; ū ng'wenūyo wība ī gīkī wamala kwejiwa ī shibi shakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū badūgū, īlī yawiza mukomeele no no no ū kūbūguzuhya ū witanwa nū būsolwa wing'we; ūlū ng'ūyīta ī mihayo yenīyī, mutūgwa na hado yaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū mu gīko, mukūlugūlīlwa mita ngalī gwa kwingīla mo ū mu būtemi butashilaga, ū bo ng'wa Seeba na Mpīja wise Yesu Kilisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ī nguno yene ī ng'hūmbū jane ū nene jilī kūng'wizūkīja gwa ī mihayo yenīyī nūūlū īkī ng'wīmanile, nū būtūngīlīja ūbo mulī nabo ī haha mubūdimile na nguzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī ū nene ūlū nataalī mo ū ng'wiheema lya mīlī gwenūyū, naliganika īlī chiza ū kūmanūmusatūla kūlwa kūng'wizūkīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū Seeba wise Yesu Kilisito wanoolekegije hape gīkī lyegeelaga ī likanza lya kūlīzuula ī liheema lyenīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, nalī na ng'hūmbū no no no gīkī, nūūlū nalīnge, ī mihayo yenīyī muyūyizūkwa būlī gwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.1.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūhangwa kwa ng'wa Kilisito n'ikūjo lyakwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno aho twamulangaga ī mihayo ya būdūla bo ng'wa Seeba wise Yesu Kilisito nī ya kūshoka kwakwe, twalī tūtalondeelaga ngano ja nyasala sala, bise benekīlī gete tūlī bambona bago a magaka gakwe genayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wei akanukūla ikūjo na būgūngūhiwa būtaale kūfuma kūlī Mulungu Sīswe, aho ilaka līkang'wizīīla ng'wikūjo no no no; līlīhaya gīkī, “Ūyū ng'wene Ng'wana wane Ntogwa ūyo aniyegije hataale.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bise twalī nang'hwe ū mu lūgūlū lwela, tūkaliigwa nī lilaka lyenīlo aho lyenhwa kūfuma ū ng'wigūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū kūhaya ū mhayo gwa būhangi ūyo tūlī nago, gūlī gwa ng'hana gete. Hūna lūūlū mukūtūngīlīja no ūlū ng'ūgūdīlīla gītī tala īyo īkwaakaga ng'wipandī lya giiti, kūshisha wangalūke; kūshisha ī sonda ya dilū īng'wakīīle ū mu myoyo ying'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike gūmanagi tame ū mhayo ūyū; gīkī, pyī ū būhangi ūbo būlī mu shandīkwa būtīko kūshomelejiwa gīt'ūmo munhū atogelilwe wei ng'wenekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū būhangi būtenhilwe ikanza lyose lyose kūlwa kūlondeela katogelwe ka ng'wa munhū, alīyo būkenhwa na Moyo Ng'wela kūbītīla mu banhū, abo basomboolaga ya kūfuma kūlī Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
